========================================================================
SYSTEM OVERVIEW

This Browser OS is a multi-engine, microVM-based secure browsing platform designed around:

Strong isolation (tab/workspace/VM separation)
Controlled virtualization (microVM + container hybrid)
Anti-fingerprinting + obfuscation (defensive privacy layer)
Network anonymity routing (Tor/I2P/Nym compatible)
Ephemeral-by-default execution model
Correlation resistance + side-channel mitigation
